  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Natiira Ateni Irrigation Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Irrigated agriculture Town/City: Natiira Village The project funds will be used to drill a borewell and lay a 2-acre drip irrigation system, renovate the office, hire office staff; train staff in good governance practices; train group members on crop selection and pest management and train staff in financial management; develop policies for finances, human resources, and procurement; and purchase office equipment and farm inputs..</narrative>
  </description>
